## 4. Implementation Phasing

1. **Sprint 1**: Foundation & Scaffolding (Laravel 11, Breeze React/Inertia, PostgreSQL RLS base macros).
2. **Sprint 2**: Tenancy Middleware & RBAC (Multi-tenant domain resolution, session isolation, user authentication).
3. **Sprint 3**: Talent Matrix (Scholar CRUD, expertise indexing, public bio generation).
4. **Sprint 4**: Policy Editorial Pipeline (Structured draft editor, version diffing, automated embargo release).
5. **Sprint 5**: Salon & Event Management (VIP registration, Chatham House workflows, check-in console).
6. **Sprint 6**: Agentic Synthesis (Laravel Horizon worker pipelines, LLM-driven brief generation).